== checks; building and running
a bound copy grows on its own yes
a bound copy's element is its own yes
the copy holds what was written yes
an assigned copy is independent yes
a borrowed list reads the caller's yes
a copy in the callee leaves the caller's alone yes
a returned list keeps its elements yes
a value struct holds a copy of the list yes
a copied struct's list is its own yes
a list in an owner's value field grows in place yes
lists nested in a list are each their own yes
a copy of a nested list is deep yes
a list pushed into a ListRef is a copy yes
remove moves out the first yes
swapRemove moves the last into its place yes
== exit 0
